{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "202ca22d-6d59-8a34-aa41-50405b624c0e",
  "created_at": "2026-01-23T13:04:20-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Canvassing",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Dennis M. Doyle",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Walter Tavares",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:00-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Canvassing office, this is Walter. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:04-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. I recently moved, and I'm trying to figure out how to register to vote. Register to vote after moving. I'm not sure if I have to do anything or if it just follows me."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:17-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure. Did you move within Newport, or from another city or town?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "From another town. Within Rhode Island, though. Within Rhode Island, yeah. About a month ago."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:28-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Then you'll need to update your registration to your new address. You can do that with a new voter registration form. You can fill it out online through the state, or we can mail you one, or you can come by and do it here."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:43-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Through the state. Online through the state. And that counts for Newport? It's not a Newport thing?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:49-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It goes through the state system, but it's assigned to the city or town of your new address. So once it's processed, you'll be on the Newport voter list."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:01:59-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "On the Newport list. Okay. Now, what ID is required? Do I need to send a copy of something with it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:02:06-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When you register, they'll ask for your Rhode Island driver's license or state ID number, or the last four digits of your Social Security number if you don't have one of those. Then when you vote in person, you'll need to show an acceptable photo ID."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:02:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Last four of the Social. And a photo ID to vote. So, wait, you cannot vote without the photo ID? Cannot, or can? I want to make sure I heard that right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:02:32-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Let me say it clearly. You can vote without it in some cases, but you'd cast a provisional ballot, and there are steps afterward. So the best thing is to bring your photo ID with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:02:45-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Can, but provisional. Provisional ballot. So it's not that I cannot, it's that it's, um, a different kind of ballot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:02:52-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right. It's a different process, and it may not be counted unless the ID is verified. Bringing the ID avoids all of that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:00-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Avoids all of that. Okay. My license still has my old address on it. Is that a problem? Is that a problem for the ID?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:09-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally the ID just needs to be a valid photo ID. It doesn't have to match your current address. But you should update your address with the DMV anyway, and when you register online, you can do both at once."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:22-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Do both at once. Oh, that's good. So I do the DMV thing and the voter thing together."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:28-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, if you go through the online option, it usually prompts you. If it doesn't, give us a call back and we'll point you in the right direction."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:37-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Point me in the right direction. Okay. And if I want you to mail me the form instead, I just give you my address?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:45-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, your new mailing address, and we'll send one out. I can take it now if you'd like."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:03:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, no, I think I'll try online first. Try it online. If I get stuck I'll call back. Is this a good number for you, this one, the main line?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:04:01-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, this is the right number. We're here until the end of the day."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:04:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Until end of day. All right. I think I've got it. Register online, bring photo ID, and, uh, provisional if I forget. Thank you, Walter."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-23T13:04:15-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got it. Thanks for calling, Mr. Doyle. Have a good afternoon."
    }
  ],
